  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white pt-8\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 xl:flex items-center gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"xl:w-3/5 xl:order-2 mb-8 xl:mb-0\"><img src=\"/assets/questions-m-collection-e0ee8cbb.jpg\" class=\"rounded w-full\"></div><div class=\"xl:w-2/5 xl:order-1\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-4xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight mb-4 xl:mb-6\">How to find the vehicle of your dreams</h1><p class=\"mb-4 xl:mb-10\">Buying and selling classic vehicles should be easy. Find answers to our most frequently asked questions.</p><a href=\"/en/question_categories/buying\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Buying</a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/selling\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Selling</a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Bidding</a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Documentation</a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/account\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Account</a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/payment\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Payments</a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Shipping</a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/verification\" class=\"inline-block text-sm mr-2 mb-2 px-2 py-1 border border-black rounded hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Verification</a></div></div><ul class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center mb-16\"><li class=\"flex flex-col justify-between items-center bg-racing-300 rounded py-5 px-6 mb-4 sm:mb-0\"><div><i class=\"icon text-5xl text-green-700 mb-6\">sell</i><h3 class=\"text-xl font-light mb-2\">Get started</h3><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\">Create your account, verify yourself, and find your dream car.</p></div><a href=\"/en/question_categories/account\" class=\"text-sm text-green-600\">Learn more</a></li><li class=\"flex flex-col justify-between items-center bg-racing-300 rounded py-5 px-6 mb-4 sm:mb-0\"><div><i class=\"icon text-5xl text-green-700 mb-6\">gavel</i><h3 class=\"text-xl font-light mb-2\">Place a bid</h3><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\">Participate in the bidding and win the auction.</p></div><a href=\"/en/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"text-sm text-green-600\">Learn more</a></li><li class=\"flex flex-col justify-between items-center bg-racing-300 rounded py-5 px-6 mb-4 sm:mb-0\"><div><i class=\"icon text-5xl text-green-700 mb-6\">verified</i><h3 class=\"text-xl font-light mb-2\">Contact the seller</h3><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\">Bidders Highway helps you make the deal as quick and smooth as possible.</p></div><a href=\"/en/question_categories/buying\" class=\"text-sm text-green-600\">Learn more</a></li><li class=\"flex flex-col justify-between items-center bg-racing-300 rounded py-5 px-6 mb-4 sm:mb-0\"><div><i class=\"icon text-5xl text-green-700 mb-6\">directions_car</i><h3 class=\"text-xl font-light mb-2\">Get your vehicle home</h3><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\">Everything that needs to be dealt with after a successful auction.</p></div><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"text-sm text-green-600\">Learn more</a></li></ul><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 lg:flex gap-4 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 lg:order-2 mb-8 lb:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Categories</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/en/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">All</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Buying</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Selling</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bidding</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Documentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Account</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Payments</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Shipping</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verification</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"lg:w-3/4 lg:order-1\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-medium mb-6 lg:pl-6\">Frequently asked questions</h2><ul><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>Can I withdraw my bid?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">All bids are binding and it is up to you as the bidder to ensure that you feel safe and comfortable placing a bid based on the information available. More about this in our terms and conditions.</p><a href=\"/en/questions/can-i-withdraw-my-bid_29b32eb5-99f6-4362-8d81-5e8938247053\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>What are the bid increments?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">Minimum bid increments:</p><a href=\"/en/questions/what-are-the-bid-increments_3684f688-3dd8-4916-ba67-2aca72d21063\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>What happens if a bidder places a bid at the last second in an attempt to \"snipe\" the auction?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">If bids are received right towards the end of the auction, it will be extended by two minutes each time a bid is placed.</p><a href=\"/en/questions/what-happens-if-a-bidder-places-a-bid-at-the-last-second-in-an-attempt-to-snipe-the-auction_9b79d704-102b-45b5-9ee8-7358bc3770f1\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>What type of inspection is performed on the cars?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">We try to inspect as many cars as we can, although this is not always possible. We do however conduct detailed interviews with potential sellers about the car's history, origin and condition. All available information about the object is then included in the listing. The seller confirms with a binding signature via BankID that the information given in the auction listing is correct. It is there...</p><a href=\"/en/questions/what-type-of-inspection-is-performed-on-the-cars_0f65b365-1b3e-4444-be93-5005970edfad\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>Can I advertise my car on other marketplaces while my auction is live?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">It is perfectly acceptable to place ads on other sites or in your social channels to attract visitors to your auction on Bidders Highway, but it is important that you do not specify a price so as not to disrupt the bidding. However, if Bidders Highway has set up an auction for you, we have exclusive rights to the sale, i.e. you cannot sell the car via another marketplace while you have an ongoi...</p><a href=\"/en/questions/can-i-advertise-my-car-on-other-marketplaces-while-my-auction-is-live_65a8c0f7-0f0c-4951-b1fe-0872d0d04f93\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>Can I inspect the car during the auction?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">You can always ask in the comments section if it's possible to come and view the car, but it is entirely up to the seller to grant a viewing. Note that buyers and sellers are prohibited from initiating separate negotiations on site as the item is handled exclusively by Bidders Highway during an ongoing auction.</p><a href=\"/en/questions/can-i-inspect-the-car-during-the-auction_8d8f6e42-834d-4361-a0d7-486ac9118fff\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>How do I know what my car is worth?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">It is of course good if you have an idea of ​​what you want to pay for your car. But valuation and pricing are always done in dialogue with us. We have experienced experts who can assess the value of your car depending on condition and model. Based on this, we can agree on a reasonable reservation price if you want it.</p><a href=\"/en/questions/how-do-i-know-what-my-car-is-worth_bdc5f70a-41f0-40fe-b51e-51606067f611\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>Can I contact the seller afterwards if the auction doesn't reach the reserve price?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">If an auction ends without reaching its reserve price, the three highest bidders will receive an email with the opportunity to place a final bid within 24 hours to reach the object's reserve price. Note, it is first come, first served and the seller can choose to accept new bids directly via Bidders Highway. If the bidders choose not to take advantage of this opportunity, the seller can either ...</p><a href=\"/en/questions/can-i-contact-the-seller-afterwards-if-the-auction-doesnt-reach-the-reserve-price_88e3dc61-9b37-4826-8f1a-370fe4a51120\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>Do you sell all types of vehicles?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">Bidders Highway focuses solely on enthusiast and collector vehicles, and that is of course a broad term. The best thing to do is to contact us so we can have a dialogue to see if your vehicle fits our target group.</p><a href=\"/en/questions/do-you-sell-all-types-of-vehicles_ce6ea8d5-33d7-4846-abe4-a35eeec581da\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>Is Swedish BankID required to log in?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">We'd prefer you use it if you have it, but it is not necessary. Bidders Highway wants to be the safest and most convenient marketplace for enthusiast cars and BankID is, in addition to being very easy to use as a login, also an excellent way for buyers and sellers to prove their identity. But not everyone has BankID, and we also have foreign users. There is the option to register an account and...</p><a href=\"/en/questions/is-swedish-bankid-required-to-log-in_28a737f5-8a00-4b25-bac2-2ae3b3a8e0cc\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>What happens if the lot doesn't match the description given in the auction listing?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">Bidders Highway facilitates auctions on our platform, but it is up to the bidder to form as good an opinion of the item as possible before placing a binding bid. It is further up to the seller to state and certify that the information in the listing is correct and that nothing of a material nature has been omitted.</p><a href=\"/en/questions/what-happens-if-the-lot-doesnt-match-the-description-given-in-the-auction-listing_51f4c750-5b80-42a5-a9b4-e5f3b8e07c71\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li><li><details class=\"open:px-6 lg:px-6 pt-4 pb-1 mb-2 group open:bg-white open:rounded\"><summary class=\"flex gap-3 group-open:mb-4 justify-between items-start text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-zest transition-colors\"><span>How much does it cost to sell with Bidders Highway?</span><i class=\"icon text-4xl group-open:hidden\">add</i><i class=\"icon text-4xl hidden group-open:block\">remove</i></summary><div><p class=\"mb-4\">For the work done on your auction, we charge a fixed sales fee of SEK 2,995 (incl. VAT) per published auction. The fee includes: professional photography, valuation and advice, copy and layout of the ad, publication on Bidders Highway, exposure in newsletters and social channels, and publication on selected external advertising sites (e.g. mobile.de and Blocket). We also charge a variable fee o...</p><a href=\"/en/questions/how-much-does-it-cost-to-sell-with-bidders-highway_dbe629ba-50fc-4283-9670-7e15e09ff9cf\" class=\"block underline hover:text-neutral-800 pb-4\">Learn more</a></div></details></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Other questions?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">You can send us an email. We'll be happy to help!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/en\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">View all our car auctions</a></div></div></main>",
